	(text "Notes:\n- J1 sits on the panel-facing (top) side, positioned like Waveshare's J3 so the panel FPC tail folds behind\n  the glass and reaches it. FPC enters from -X (board left). Max part height on top: 1.0 mm (FPC fold gap ~2.3 mm).\n- J2 is 13 bare SMD pads on the bottom side in a ring r=5.5 mm around the board centre (motor hollow shaft).\n- Panel 3V3 (3V3_LCD) is switched on board B (LCD_EN). Bulk/HF decoupling here, close to the FPC 3V3 pins.\n- LCD_TE is brought to a test pad only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
